        "description": "Malzahar summons Voidlings to attack nearby enemies.",
        "tooltip": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> Malzahar's other Abilities give him a stack when cast (max 2).<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active:</span> Malzahar summons a Voidling plus an additional Voidling per stack. Voidlings last 8/8/9/9/10 seconds and deal <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(12/14/16/18/20 + (40% bonus Attack Damage) + (20% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> each hit.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Voidlings deal 300% damage to lane minions affected by <span>Malefic Visions</span>.<br />Voidlings deal 50% damage to epic monsters.</span>",
